ation", "text": "λελασμένος ὅσσ' ἐπεπόνθει Od. 13.92", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": fut. Med. in pass. sense, once in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S.", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", οὐδέ ποτε λησόμενον οἷον ἔφυ κακόν never will be forgotten, El. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1249", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (lyr.); cf. ἐπιλανθάνω. forget purposely, pass over, ἢ λάθετ' ἢ οὐκ ἐνόησεν either he chose to forget it . . , "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 9.537", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μαθοῦσιν αὐδῶ, κοὐ μαθοῦσι λήθομαι A. Ag. 39", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". in later writers fut. Med. is used like Act. , escape notice, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἡμᾶς Arist. APr. 66a31", "author_abbreviation": "Arist.", "tlg_author": "0086", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A.R. 3.737", "author_abbreviation": "A.R.", "tlg_author": "0001", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Luc. Sacr. 14", "author_abbreviation": "Luc.", "tlg_author": "0062", "tlg_work": "027", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": abs., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Alciphr. 3.52", "author_abbreviation": "Alciphr.", "tlg_author": "0640", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". "}]}